WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.700
Welcome to SPA Holiday House Režek in Lovinac.

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:07.000
You are now watching the technical instructions for the house.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Let's start with the most important part: how to lock and unlock the house.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
At the keypad next to the door, first press the power button.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Then enter the code we sent you.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
You will hear a soft click from the cylinder beneath the handle.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Turn it like a key to unlock the house.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The same procedure applies for locking the house,

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
turning it in the opposite direction.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.000
As soon as you enter, on your left you will find the instructions, important numbers and the Wi-Fi password.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.000
On your right, next to the bathroom door, there is a photo of the surrounding area.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.000
To the right of the entrance door there is a first aid kit. We hope you will not need it.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
On the opposite side there are sports items for your enjoyment,

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.000
and the key to the spa area hangs there as well.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:03.000
The kitchen appliances are standard, so we believe you will not need any help with those.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.000
In the living room you will find three remote controls.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.000
The smallest one switches the lights on and off:

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.000
the light above the TV and the one in the corner.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Simply press on or off.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:32.000
The next remote is for the air conditioner, which can cool the room or heat it on cold nights.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:51.000
The third remote is for the TV. Besides the usual functions, it also switches between TV, satellite and PlayStation.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:00.000
To switch from terrestrial TV to satellite, press the OK button.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Then the yellow button, and a menu will appear.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:16.000
Air means the local terrestrial channels, while Satellite, lower in the menu, gives you the satellite channels.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:22.000
Go to Satellite, press OK, and the list of satellite channels will appear.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:41.000
The speaker is switched on and off with the switch on the back, in position one or position two.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.000
It must always be plugged into power.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:49.000
To switch it off, put the switch in the neutral middle position.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:04.000
Once it is on, it goes into Bluetooth search mode. Find it on your phone and connect.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:10.000
The large dial is for the volume, and the microphone turns on with the button next to it.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.000
For extra enjoyment, a sauna is at your disposal.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:31.000
You turn it on with this button. The display and the heaters light up. Press again to turn it off.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:39.000
The button on the far right turns on the light therapy. Each press changes the colour.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:55.000
The last press turns the light off. Below this panel there is a radio and an MP3 player. For the hot tub you only need two buttons.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:03.000
The lower one turns on the light; further presses reduce the intensity until it goes off.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:09.000
The upper button turns on the massage.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:19.000
A second press increases it to maximum, and a third press turns the massage off.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:27.000
By turning these two large round knobs, or this third one, you increase or decrease the massage intensity at individual jets.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:39.000
This odd little device is actually very useful. It is a hand vacuum for the hot tub.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:44.000
Put your thumb on the top to close the hole, push the vacuum into the water, then remove your thumb and the suction starts.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:58.000
Vacuum for as long as there is suction, then take it out of the water. The water drains away and the dirt stays inside.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:09.000
Remember one important rule: the water will only be as clean as you are. There is also a little help for disinfection.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:15.000
These are chlorine tablets. Put one in the filter every three or four days, depending on how much you use the tub.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:23.000
However, the disinfection does not work if you bathed with sunscreen on, because it upsets the pH balance.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:29.000
We keep the tablets away from children, in the bathroom cabinet, in this spot.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:44.000
And this is Žak. He cleans the pool, but he needs your help. Please put him in the pool at least once a day. That keeps your water and the pool floor clean.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:56.000
Still, Žak cannot do everything. Shower before entering the water, do not run across the grass and jump in, and avoid going in covered in sunscreen.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:09.000
You start Žak on his base, by pressing this button. Pressing the lower right button extends the usual one hour of cleaning by another half hour.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:18.000
Press this button again, the two lower lights will blink twice and the cleaning begins.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:37.000
When taking the robot out of the pool, pull him to the surface by the cord, but do not lift him out by it.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.000
That is what this handle is for.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:53.000
Žak cleans the pool, and you have to clean Žak. Press this yellow button and pull out the filter.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.000
Press the two yellow tabs underneath.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:07.000
Take it out and rinse it in clean water.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:25.000
This is the thermal cover for the pool. The pool must be covered every night, otherwise in the morning you may find worms, frogs or similar creatures at the bottom.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:36.000
Please close the parasols whenever it is windy.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:48.000
From 9 in the evening until 6 in the morning our mower Robi moves around the garden, and the irrigation starts at the same time. Take care not to get wet.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:58.000
Firewood for the barbecue and the fireplace is included in your price. If you need more, or you would like to charge your electric vehicle, please contact us.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:10.000
We have to register your stay in the eVisitor system. That is why we ask you to send a copy of your ID card, passport or another valid document to our email or WhatsApp.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:15.000
As soon as we register you, your documents are deleted.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:28.000
Damage can happen. We are insured for small amounts, but if something happens, please tell us right away so we can report it.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:36.000
We wish you a wonderful holiday and a pleasant stay at our SPA Holiday House Režek.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:45.000
For any other questions about the area, restaurants, shops and the like, please visit our website.
